}

decision amended-response-window: "Rule 12 Response Window (Amended Pleading)" by applicant cite "FRCP 15(a)(3)"
{
  group pleading-group
  note "Unless the court orders otherwise, a response to an amended pleading is due within the time remaining to respond to the original pleading or within 14 days after service of the amended pleading, whichever is later (Rule 15(a)(3)); the pack models the 14 days. A Rule 12(b) motion against the amended pleading runs on the same clock."
